{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>游嘉欣（游游）在TVB《夫妻的博弈》中與馬國明飾演一對「豪門兄妹」，憑藉百變的造型以及率真的性格成功引起網民關注。私下的她亦十分活躍於社交平台，不時大方分享日常美照來回饋粉絲。日前她便晒出了一輯充滿仙氣的靚相，驚喜展示全新髮型！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"af294903-a86b-4950-b554-76d9eec862b8.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026QBuPWMIbUm1786502942.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"af294903-a86b-4950-b554-76d9eec862b8.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"42f75b0d-979b-452a-af40-e2ffa781f5f6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Ca6bMoJX5i1786502942.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42f75b0d-979b-452a-af40-e2ffa781f5f6.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p id=\"p-rc_764bab7bff1d81e7-814\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_764bab7bff1d81e7-814\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從相片中可見，游游身穿一襲露肩印花長裙，在空氣瀏海的加持下，舉手投足間都散發出優雅的氣質。相中見她在藍色背景牆下大擺可愛甫士，配上甜美的笑容，瞬間融化了大批網民的心。大家紛紛留言狂讚她的新髮型非常適合，大讚「越嚟越靚女」！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T14:08:18.730822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}